      "spam": false,
      "value": "I removed my finger pen and weapons because they were \"randomly\" activating as I was walking around. This feature could solve this.\n\nOn avatar descriptor, instead of the two fields for animation overrides, have an array of structs { set name, standing overrides, sitting overrides }. By default select and use first set. If more than one set is defined show sub-menu in menu \"Animation Override Sets\" where you can select which set you want to use.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a667c30c58aa56006cd1280",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5a4b034d1ab4366d42644996",
        "alias": "Aegean Pelican",
        "aliasID": "65c2a245ed6eefce4c6938c0",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/3c5acd8373c1a323c0e3236054bea824.png",
        "created": "2018-01-02T03:58:05.987Z",
