      "postID": "5a5da9f5af44d4283ed387c4",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I agree that this would be a really neat feature. I know a lot a people (including myself) who have like 10 copies of the exact same avatar just to be able to switch between different animation sets.\n\nMost people usually override only the handgun and rock&roll gestures because they want to keep the other gestures. That means only 2 overrides per avatar. Having multiple animation sets would allow us to keep all the original gestures on one set and then override all of them on another set.\n\nFinally I also believe it would have a good impact on the server capacity and bandwidth as we wouldn't have 10 copies of the exact same avatar anymore and people wouldn't have to load them each time we switch.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
